          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nuko Simoni Petero n’uwundi mwigishwa bakurikira Yesu. Uwo mwigishwa wundi yari azwi n’umuherezi mukuru, ivyo vyatumye yemererwa kwinjirana na Yesu mu rugo rw’umuherezi mukuru, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.18.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.18.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 18:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ariko Petero we asigara hanze. Maze wa mwigishwa yari azwi n’umuherezi mukuru aragaruka avugana n’umukobwa yarinda umuryango, na we yemerera Petero kwinjira.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.18.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.18.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
